VALUES ('tpl_exitinterview', 'exit-interview', 'Exit interview', 'HR', 'Ask why someone is leaving in a way they can answer honestly.', 'Leaving is when people say what they meant. Keep it structured enough to count across a year of departures, open enough to catch the thing no option covers, and make clear it''s confidential.', '["retention","people ops","offboarding"]', 'LogOut', 'contact', 2, 6, '{"schemaVersion":4,"title":"Exit interview","description":"Ask why someone is leaving in a way they can answer honestly.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_exitinte00","ref":"welcome","title":"Before you go — your honest answers help the people staying. This is confidential.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_exitinte01","ref":"primary_reason","title":"What''s the main reason you''re leaving?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_compensation","label":"Compensation","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_career_growth","label":"Career growth","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_manager_or_team","label":"Manager or team","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_work_life_balance","label":"Work-life balance","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_company_direction","label":"Company direction","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_personal_reasons","label":"Personal reasons","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_exitinte02","ref":"ratings","title":"How would you rate each of these?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"matrix","rows":[{"id":"opt_row_your_manager","label":"Your manager"},{"id":"opt_row_your_team","label":"Your team"},{"id":"opt_row_compensation","label":"Compensation"},{"id":"opt_row_growth_opportunities","label":"Growth opportunities"},{"id":"opt_row_work_life","label":"Work-life balance"}],"columns":[{"id":"opt_col_poor","label":"Poor"},{"id":"opt_col_fair","label":